# codecs/json: to-json-pretty handles nested dicts with multi-level indentation
[include %libdir "codecs/json.llt"]

---

[to-json-pretty [
  name: "Alice"
  data: [
    age: 30
    active: true
  ]
]]
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: to-json-pretty (did you mean the string "to-json-pretty"? Use quotes.) (defined at 5:2-5:16)

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: to-json-pretty
